{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AKUMA's BLOODRAIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be prepared to face <strong>hordes of</strong> <strong>akumas/yokais</strong> that are attacking and creating caos in a small japanese village. You're the only ninja alive that can protect this village from the eternal pain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must <strong>slaughter all enemies</strong> without mercy before the time is up, the <strong>quicker and bloodier</strong> the better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Akuma's Bloodrain</strong> is a <strong>fast-paced boomer shooter</strong> inspired by the classics DOOM and Shadow Warrior, where you have to use your <strong>weapons and ninja reflexes</strong> in the maximum level to beat the <strong>waves of akumas. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/9af1de4ceee6a701421c476ed366dc03.poster.avif?t=1757937788\" width=616 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/9af1de4ceee6a701421c476ed366dc03.webm?t=1757937788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/9af1de4ceee6a701421c476ed366dc03.mp4?t=1757937788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use you powerful shotgun to blow up your enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot enemies with wisdow! You won't be out of bullets but the enemy can catch you before you finish the reload.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/3a2ec9d98559d57b19ce322289082dbe.poster.avif?t=1757937788\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/3a2ec9d98559d57b19ce322289082dbe.webm?t=1757937788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/3a2ec9d98559d57b19ce322289082dbe.mp4?t=1757937788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/b1c0c0037d804a012abc785dd9732cca.poster.avif?t=1757937788\" width=616 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/b1c0c0037d804a012abc785dd9732cca.webm?t=1757937788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/b1c0c0037d804a012abc785dd9732cca.mp4?t=1757937788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use your claws to tear your enemies in pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slashing enemies will not do much damage and if you may be in a dangerous position, but if you slash them when they are low health you will finish them much quicker, being able to score more points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/8b90991fea9dc7e19a07572fa01c2f29.poster.avif?t=1757937788\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/8b90991fea9dc7e19a07572fa01c2f29.webm?t=1757937788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/8b90991fea9dc7e19a07572fa01c2f29.mp4?t=1757937788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/bab141f166d4c806f13987e3712480bb.poster.avif?t=1757937788\" width=616 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/bab141f166d4c806f13987e3712480bb.webm?t=1757937788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/bab141f166d4c806f13987e3712480bb.mp4?t=1757937788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash and climb in high speed to hunt your enemies before they can even react.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast-pace game, if you are not dashing through the map to hunt your enemies you're doing it wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/ca5423303184df0122b149f7a95a6055.poster.avif?t=1757937788\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/ca5423303184df0122b149f7a95a6055.webm?t=1757937788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/extras/ca5423303184df0122b149f7a95a6055.mp4?t=1757937788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Message from developers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;We're brothers developing games, and Akuma i